description:
What: After append_to_groups() returns article number assignments, insert overview records for each group.
Algorithm:
1. In crates/reader/src/session/lifecycle.rs, in run_post_pipeline():
   a. After the append_to_groups() call (which now returns assignments):
      let (header_bytes, body_bytes) = split_article(article_bytes);
      let mut base_record = extract_overview(&header_bytes, &body_bytes);
      for (group_name, article_number) in &assignments {
          let record = OverviewRecord { article_number: *article_number, ..base_record.clone() };
          if let Err(e) = stores.overview_store.insert(group_name, &record).await {
              warn!("overview insert failed for {group_name}: {e}");
              // non-fatal: overview index corruption is recoverable; POST still succeeded
          }
      }
2. Import extract_overview from store::overview
3. Add test: POST an article -> query overview_store.query_range() -> article appears
Defensive: overview failure is non-fatal (warn, continue); never abort POST due to overview error.
Acceptance: integration test post_then_over_returns_article passes; cargo test clean.
